        <mxCell id="_Ayyw4fwqHdVNkr7ipAM-93" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;In Debug taken state we need to do following things&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Kill all the instructions in the pipeline&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Save the most valid PC in dpc register&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Raise the pc_valid for IF stage with pc &amp;lt;= dm_haltaddr_i&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Update the cause in dcsr&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
