        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_Ayyw4fwqHdVNkr7ipAM-95" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 6px;&quot;&gt;In functional state we need to do following things&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;All the kill signal to the pipeline should be 0&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;csr save cause should be 0, i.e noting needs to be saved&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;pc_valid will be 0, since normal PC needs to there in IF stage&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
